  at k=9 the excess is +0.056, a change of -0.081 +/- 0.025 against k=4 (3.3 SE)
  -- and that change is NOT a capacity curve: k=4's spacing is DOUBLE,
     so it mixes vocabulary size with a 2x resolution change.
  k9+ excess against this project's own 3 SE bar (n=36):  6.3 SE  -> REAL
  the model at k9+   F1 measured 0.361 vs predicted 0.362  (meets geometry)
